Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}私下说，我们能做出节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Between you and me, we can make shows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正有意义的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that actually mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有约翰·布斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there is John Booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚买下我们电视台的那个人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guy that just bought our network?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里所有人都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone here knows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你才是《永恒》真正的创造者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you're the true creator of "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个传奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想跟我回家吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸去世了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}葬礼在明天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Funeral's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还得找口棺材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still need a coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎本季的追求者，达瑞斯·贝克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome this season's suitor, Darius Beck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安有动作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你真想回家，有一件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you really want to go home, there is one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎所有男人都不希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pretty much every guy does not want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己未来的妻子去做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}their potential wife to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗，什么事……睡他们的朋友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, what's that... Screw their friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比，你今晚有安排吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby, do you have plans this evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比在哪？我现在就要见我女儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Ruby? I want to see my daughter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-露比！  -爸？！ -搞什么鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ruby!   -Dad?!   -What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以成为我爸口中你并不是的那种人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can be everything my father says that you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会太费劲了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be too much work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每天让你失望，露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}disappointing you every day, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个自私、爱操控人的婊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a selfish, manipulative bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想降我的职？就当着我的面降。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to demote me? You demote me to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，孩子。我是切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, kiddo. It's Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你衣服穿好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You decent?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还穿着礼服呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still in your dress, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我拉链卡住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, my zipper got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米不能逍遥法外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy can't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有。我开除他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't. I fired him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那我要去报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, I'm gonna go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是觉得我们这儿从来什么都不举报，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just don't feel like we ever report anything around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再当又一个沉默的女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm just not gonna be another silent woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我现在就去报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I'm just gonna go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。警察和杰瑞米……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know know. The police and Jeremy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得这是个好主意吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这主意非常好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's a really good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定要这样对杰瑞米吗？——确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you want to do that to Jeremy? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定要这样对我们吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you want to do that to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:52.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米知道所有见不得光的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy knows where all the bodies are buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些尸体是从屋顶掉下去的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some bodies fall off of roofs,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而某些人把这事掩盖了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and certain people cover that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:58.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到他对我做了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see what he did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到了。我当时都想杀了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I saw what he did. I thought I was gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:05.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这是我们各执一词，如果他说出去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's our word against his, and if he talks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事必须内部消化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has to stay in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 昨夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Last night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我想起了你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I thought of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 多年前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 当身躯生长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* When bodies grew
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 空荡的家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Empty home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 空无一人的地狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* A vacant Hell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我认识你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I knew you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 在这残酷的领域\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* In the harsh realm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们一年一度的春季仪式……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is our annual rite of spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有含苞的郁金香、盛开的樱花，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with budding tulips, flowering cherry blossoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而在《永恒》这里，初生的爱情正在绽放\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and here on "Everlasting," the efflorescing of nascent love
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为一位幸运女士有机会带达瑞斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as one lucky lady gets a chance to take Darius
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去家乡约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a hometown date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在这座豪宅大门外，美国，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But outside the gates of this mansion, America,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每段感情都要接受现实生活的考验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}every relationship is put to the real-life test.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会中选？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who will be chosen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的恋情能撑下去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And will their romance survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对一个没有朋友的男人来说，那束花可真大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For a man with no friends, that was an enormous bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是切特送的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, they're from Chet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而切特只懂一种风格，就是大得夸张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Chet only knows one way, which is enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接下来去哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往好处想，任何事都比\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bright side, anything's a step up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲的葬礼强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over your father's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过会很有意思吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you it would be a barrel of laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:59.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得坦白一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to come clean about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去那个颁奖礼是为了见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went to that awards show to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受宠若惊。是为了向你提案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm flattered. To pitch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了勾引你，让你给我一个电视网来经营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To seduce you into giving me one of your networks to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在……你不想要电视网了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But now... You don't want a network anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我想要电视网。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I want a network.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:13.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可能也想要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I might want you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得巴哈马怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you feel about the Bahamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。让我猜猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拥有一家酒店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You own a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，那是一个位于独立群岛上的生态度假村。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, it's an eco-resort on its very own archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，所以你拥有几座岛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, so, you own some islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，那你得再下点功夫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Well, you're gonna have to work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能让我刮目相看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a little harder than that to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:53.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们看起来像一对真正的权势情侣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We look like a real power-producing couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.43,0:05:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。太夸张了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚的事，对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry about last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨晚心情有点怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just in a weird mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我一整晚都在想你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought about you all night, though. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且是特别好的那种想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, really good thoughts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜也是。我只是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet. I just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在不想听那些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to hear about them just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……呃，我嘴里一股咖啡味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... Ugh. I have, like, this crazy coffee breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，也许再刷一次牙吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Maybe brush your teeth again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的，我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你知道今天会乱成一团\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, you know that today's gonna be totally crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要拍家乡约会。这些姑娘简直……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with the hometown dates. These girls are just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，杰伊和麦迪逊能搞定，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Well, Jay and Madison can handle it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我现在该去处理达里厄斯的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just feel like I should go deal with Darius
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就现在，你懂我意思吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}right now, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你是说劝他选贝丝·安，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you mean talking him into picking Beth Ann,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那祝你好运。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}good luck with that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！对，你确实得刷个牙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoo! Yeah, definitely brush your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}家乡约会宣传词，第一条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hometown dates pitch, take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我迫不及待想让你见见我全家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't wait for you to meet the whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望你喜欢南方菜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hope you like Southern cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周末古根海姆有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a Frank Lloyd Wright exhibit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克·劳埃德·赖特的展览。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at The Guggenheim this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多讽刺啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How ironic is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:56.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在亚特兰大，没人比“大D”更有分量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one is bigger in the ATL than the Big "D."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没想过我会爱上一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never thought that I could fall in love
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橄榄球员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很想让我的警察同事们看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just really want to show my fellow police officers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}芝加哥的警察也能让黑人坐她的车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that a cop in Chicago can have a black man in her car
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是戴着手铐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without him being in handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，讽刺的是弗兰克·劳埃德·赖特\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, it's ironic because Frank Lloyd Wright
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}设计了古根海姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}designed The Guggenheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:13.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秋葵、炸鸡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okra, fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好回家见我人生中的主教练了吗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ready to come home and meet the head coach in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想给我戴上戒指……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to put a ring on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸？你得先问他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my dad? You got to ask him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能……我能重来一遍吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I... Can I start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰伊，你干嘛做那种表情？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you making that face, Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺搞笑的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}温暖、让人安心……正是一个妻子该有的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Warm, comforting... Just as a wife should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，达里厄斯，你怎么想？你做好选择了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what do you think, Darius? Have you made your choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真难选，格雷厄姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tough call, Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这些姑娘都各有各的好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, all these ladies have so much to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我需要点时间好好想想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'm gonna need some time to reflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢，瑞秋？这样当广告前收尾可以吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think, Rach? Is that okay for an act break?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吊着观众猜他选谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tension over who to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，格雷厄姆，可以，但别思考，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Graham, it's fine, but don't think, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}思考会让你显胖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It makes you look fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“D”，你怎么样？挺好。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"D," how you doing? Good. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尚塔尔看起来挺不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal looked pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，那你为什么告诉格雷厄姆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Well, then why did you tell Graham
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还没决定？因为我确实没决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you hadn't decided yet? 'Cause I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰伊说我就该等等……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Jay said that I should just wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:06:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制造戏剧张力什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dramatic tension or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我心里全是亚特兰大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm all about that ATL.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼，你是说阿拉巴马？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh. You mean Alabama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:06.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉巴马？我为什么要去阿拉巴马？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alabama? Why would I be going to Alabama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，因为你要选贝丝·安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, because you're gonna pick Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那位炸鸡西瓜小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Miss Fried Chicken and Watermelon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我看不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得行。我能跟你说句实话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think so. Can I be honest with you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道。你能吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一集你对鲁比做的事真的很过分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last episode was really harsh, what you did to Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:17.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，我做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa. What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说粉丝现在把她看成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying that the fans now see her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}受害者了，明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as this victim, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们得让你重新看起来像好人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, we got to make you look like a good guy again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为此我们需要一个反派。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and for that, we need a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人比贝丝·安更适合折磨你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is nobody better to terrorize you than Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪里不明白？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What don't you understand, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我不会跟贝丝·安去任何地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm not going anywhere with Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想被私刑处死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not trying to get lynched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}私刑处死？说得有点重了吧，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lynched? That's kind of harsh, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说重了和现实之间差得可远了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a big difference in harsh and realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想现实点，那我就现实点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to be realistic, I'll be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，尚塔尔无聊得要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Chantal is a snooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会微笑、吃好吃的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are gonna smile, eat good food,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后早早上床睡觉，就跟我们每个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and go to bed early just like every single person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}观众一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in our audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收视率会大跌，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rating's are gonna tank, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会成为《永恒》历史上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna become the lowest-rated suitor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收视最低的追求者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in "Everlasting" history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:50.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会把我们踢出电视网，卖给某个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna pull us off the network and sell us to some,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种安眠药赞助的小众有线频道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, niche cable channel sponsored by Ambien.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那之后我倒想看看你还能不能上镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like to see you get an on-camera gig after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看清楚我的嘴型。我不会去阿拉巴马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Read my lips. I'm not going to Alabama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是在问你，好吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not a question, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的四分卫，我要你执行我的战术！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am your quarterback, and I want you to run my plays!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，要是你叫战术，那你烂透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, if you're calling the plays, then you suck at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为到现在，你把我带进了硬膜外麻醉、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because so far, you've run me into an epidural,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开除我表弟，还有某个姑娘的爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}firing my cousin, and some girl's daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我把你带进了收视率，老兄，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I have run your ass into ratings, dude, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的工作，我每个愚蠢的日子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my job, and I do it every stupid day
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都在干这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of my stupid life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你非要怪我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you want to go ahead and blame me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:24.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毁掉你的人生、毁了你的事业，那你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and destroy your life and ruin your career, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:27.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就去啊。去啊，做啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then go ahead. Go ahead, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把自己搞到被取消！让我解脱吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get yourself canceled! Put me out of my misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，Rachel。冷静点，好吗？你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, Rachel. Calm down, all right? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道！我真的不知道！我没事吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know! I honestly don't know! Am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能先去收拾去阿拉巴马的行李吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you please just go pack for Alabama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我去收拾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'll go pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉巴马。阿拉巴马，我来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alabama. Alabama, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我……我去收拾行李。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm... I'm... I'm gonna pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel？你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位。都回去干活吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, guys. Let's get back to work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找点正经事做。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Find something better to do with your time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大瑟尔怎么样？怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Big Sur? What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在那边留了个房间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a room on hold
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Post Ranch Inn的，随时都能住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at the Post Ranch Inn whenever I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你就是带所有女人去那儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, is that where you take all the ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了，Chet？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪儿，丫头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在我父亲的葬礼上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm at my father's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，花收到了吗？你都没提。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, did you get the flowers? You didn't mention them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你可能不喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm thinking maybe you hated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:22.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是唯一一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are the only person
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能把我父亲的葬礼变成你的事的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who could make my father's funeral about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打电话不是为了这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not why I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:28.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，是小怪咖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, it's Little Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，她对追求者发火了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, she snapped at the suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨晚我发现她……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Last night I found her...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.37,0:09:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，在车里不是一个人，Chet。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, not alone in the car, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，会想办法的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll, uh, figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在这儿待着，抽根烟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hanging out, smoking a butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius那边怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How'd it go with Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉巴马？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alabama? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。太好了。你想坐红眼航班，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Excellent. You want a red-eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是我们早上出发？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or should we leave in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样，Wasserman。你不能去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Wasserman. You're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别闹。我当然去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it. Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，那会是24小时的蚊子和沼泽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, it's gonna be 24 hours of mosquitos and swamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会彻底受不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would totally hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想让你遭这罪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't want to do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，我现在也不是个好伴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides, I'm not great company right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，怎么……为什么？你今天怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, what... Why not? What's going on with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我们一直在说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what we've been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:33.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要带一个黑人去南方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're bringing a black guy to the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，Vassar。我们去惹点麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Vassar. Let's go get into some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠。又回到种植园了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 Damn. Back on the plantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着。你祖先受了那么多年苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look. Your ancestors suffered for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.45,0:10:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能撑过这么几天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can survive a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，一个白人女人这么说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, says the white woman
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对阿拉巴马偏远乡下的黑人男人说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to the black man in the backwoods of Alabama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么我老想拔腿就跑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do I feel the need to take off running?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该。这些人会很好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't. These people are gonna be grea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-会很棒的。  -他们会喜欢你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's gonna be great.   -They're gonna love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来了！他来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's here! He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来。出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out. Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来！来吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好了好了。大家请保持冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, all right, all right. Everybody stay calm, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，Darius！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Darius!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到阿拉巴马！阿拉巴马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Alabama! Alabama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……呼！这就是……阿拉巴马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... Whoo! This is... Alabama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们好激动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。这是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让怪胎秀开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let the freak show begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。这位是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. And who do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好吗？哦，见到你太高兴了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing? Oh, just tickled to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你妈妈。你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is your mama. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:39.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甜得像蜜。这是我哥哥Carl。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet as pie. This is my brother, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是个了不起的棒球手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One hell of a ballplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来我们的怪胎秀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kind of looks like our freak show
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:44.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要变成爱的盛宴了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is turning into a love fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那比基尼可不是凭空来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that bikini didn't come out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醉酒叔叔呢？3K党呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the drunk uncle? Where's the KKK?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信我见到Darius Beck了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot believe I'm meeting Darius Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能来我们家，我们真是高兴极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're pleased at all get out to have you in our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荣幸的是我。Carl。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pleasure's all mine. Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗……Beth Ann，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know... Beth Ann,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她尽说些你的好话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she just says the nicest things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:00.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，爸爸。她嘴甜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Daddy. She's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我们后面给你准备了东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we got something out back here for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你一个真正的阿拉巴马式欢迎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to show you a real Alabama welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说Rachel把她带走了？她是我的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean Rachel took her? She's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:07.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。她可是收视率金矿级的种族主义者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. She's a solid-gold ratings racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel当然会带走她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course Rachel took her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还是能记上一功吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I still get the credit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，板子上Beth Ann的照片挂在我名字下面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, Beth Ann's picture's under my name on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事到如今，你还保住工作就不错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At this point, you'll be lucky if you still got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不懂。Quinn爱我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know what you're talking about. Quinn loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，"第一"，Quinn谁都不爱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, "A," Quinn doesn't love anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其不爱你；"第二"，Quinn说了不算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}especially not you, and, "B," Quinn's not in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel在阿拉巴马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's down in Alabama
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞出个乡下烂摊子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}creating some sort of cracker-town shit show
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们却坐在这儿干瞪眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while we sit up here twiddling our f'ing thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以...咱们该...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So... we should...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞出个大动静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blow something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让咱们的姑娘们保持热度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep our girls in the mix
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把注意力拉回咱们身上。懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get the attention back on us. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂。完全懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:42.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，动动脑子，双马尾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Put your thinking cap on, Pigtails.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:43.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们有事要干了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去餐饮区拿杯咖啡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you grab a cup of coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便在片场转转？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from craft service and take a look around the set?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上就好。行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just be a minute. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了给我打电话。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call me when you're ready. Okay.
