Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带他去你爸的葬礼了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Took him to your dad's funeral, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:12:59.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你几乎都不认识他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hardly even know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打电话就为这个...毁我的约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that why you called... To ruin my date?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是约会。是葬礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wasn't a date. It was a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。史上最奇葩的初次约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Weirdest first date ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我恋爱了，Chet。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'm in love, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，够了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, enough, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实出事了。那孩子有麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something did happen. The kid's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是第一次吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this your first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:19.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你枪法不错，Darius。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a good shot, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.27,0:13:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能出手时我就出手，兄弟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do what I can when I can do it, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:22.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你打枪快赶上扔球了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you shoot almost as good as you throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你饿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:27.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫了点吃的。我老婆厨艺超棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got some food coming. My wife's a fantastic cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好。这边有什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay. What we got over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。坐下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Sit yourself down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给这位先生来瓶啤酒，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give this man a beer, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。这哪是电视节目，这是乡村大聚会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. This isn't a TV show, this is a hootenanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是后种族时代的南方电视购物广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, this is an infomercial for the post-racial South.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。抱歉。我是说，咱们得做点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Sorry. I mean, we got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是让Darius...等等。给我一秒钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if we get Darius to... Wait a second. Give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:42.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上回来。给我一秒钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right back. Give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet刚告诉我Jeremy的事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet just told me about Jeremy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:49.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我见到他，我要把他的蛋扯下来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and when I see him, I'm gonna rip off his balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}油炸了，逼他吃下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}deep-fry them, and forced him to eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真打算装\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you seriously gonna pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在关心我了，Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you care about me now, Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实关心你。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do care about you. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你带药了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you pack your meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:59.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，带了。老天保佑我可别有自己想法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. God forbid I should have some of my own thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:01.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血管里不淌点药就活不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without pharmaceuticals pumping through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，你刚经历了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you have been through
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}创伤，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a trauma, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在这状态没法制作节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are in no condition to produce a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我搭下一班飞机，然后我...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I'm gonna get on the next flight, and I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，谢谢关心。明天见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, thanks for caring. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎...怎么了？出什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What... What's up? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个问题。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a problem. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:20.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是...是个天大的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a... It's a real big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.93,0:14:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚发现自己怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just found out I'm having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我月经推迟了，但我以为只是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was late, but I figured it was just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为节目的事太激动了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of all the excitement with the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道该怎么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这是能发生的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, this is the worst thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最糟糕的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that could have possibly ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。Beth Ann。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:35.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听我说。会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just listen to me. This is gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:38.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们会一起度过难关，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna get through this together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我向你保证，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:44.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想让Darius知道这事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want Darius to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是他知道这孩子是我前男友的DNA，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he knew that this baby came from my ex-boyfriend's DNA,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他再也不会看我一眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he would never even look at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Brock坐过牢...不是拘留，是监狱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brock has been to prison... And not just jail, prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。那肯定会影响孩子的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. That has got to affect a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，对。这个Brock在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah. Where is this Brock guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就住在两条街外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He lives just two streets over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从小到大他都住这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's lived here my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完蛋了，Rachel。我...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so screwed, Rachel. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:06.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道你能怎么做吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what you could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以退出节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could quit the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不想退出。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't want to quit the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。因为...我真的开始感觉到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Because... I'm, like, really starting to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和Darius之间有火花了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a connection between you and Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也感觉到了。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have, too. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看得出来？天啊。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can see it? Oh, my God. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像通了电一样。说真的。是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a total spark. Honestly. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，几周前我还不会这么说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, and I wouldn't have said that a few weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这就是这节目的魔力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but that is the power of this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，可是...对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is, but... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得Darius能接受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really think that Darius could ever accept
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别人的孩子？天啊。当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}another man's child? Oh, my God. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你自己也说过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是世上最好的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's, like, the greatest guy ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真是个好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is a really nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。他会是个好爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. He'd be a good dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，还有，嗯...Beth Ann，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, and, um... Beth Ann,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸不是我的生父，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my father wasn't my biological father,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他非常非常爱我和我妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but he loved me and my mother so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真是这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我被爱得那么深，贝丝·安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I was so loved, Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。我只是想告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I'm just telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对你来说不必就此结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that this does not have to be over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以解决，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can work this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你得听我的建议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're just gonna have to listen to my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能做到吗？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you do that? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我不想离开这节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I don't want to leave the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不想你走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want you to, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。你能赢下这一局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. You could win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这坨臭狗屎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You steaming pile of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见到你我也很高兴，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice to see you, too, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打她了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You beat her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情不完全是那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not exactly how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你手一按，她左臂就淤青了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your hand on her left bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世上没有任何理由能让那成为正当的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's not a thing in the world that makes that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她胳膊肘撞我鼻子……我鼻子先断的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her elbow to my nose... Broken first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她才一米五七，杰瑞米。没有任何借口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's 5'2", Jeremy. No excuse ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:26.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信你还在替她说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe you're still defending her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到处晃悠像个小妖精\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Walks around like this little troll
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让大家都觉得“哦，可怜的瑞秋。可怜的瑞秋。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that everyone's like, "Oh, poor Rachel. Poor Rachel."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你个白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒醒吧，奎恩。她偷走了你的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wake up, Quinn. She stole your show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没了。结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gone. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:40.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总得有人站出来对抗她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody needed to stand up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？是这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah? Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？哎哟！哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about that? Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？嗯？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想怎样，杰瑞米？你想打我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want to do, Jeremy? You want to hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那让你很爽吗……打女人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does that get you off... Hitting women?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊。动手啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下次……我就把它们剁了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next time... I'm cutting them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:17:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在滚出去，别再回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now get out and don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.53,0:17:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《真相之镜》……我爱了。真的。哪个天才想出来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 "Mirror of TrMe.." I love it. I did. genius came up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。概念是你想出来的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please. You came up with the concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:10.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但把它变成现实的是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm the one bringing it to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住我们需要戏剧性，戏剧性，戏剧性。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You remember we need drama, drama, drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:15.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太注重结果了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're being very results-oriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢我的环节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like my segments
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}探讨挑衅性的话题，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to explore provocative topics,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于女性自我形象和赋权的共鸣话题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}relatable issues of female self-image and empowerment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想象选手们会真的对你敞开心扉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm imagining the contestants really opening up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很有魅力。哦，好吧……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a wonderful way about you. Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天节目在阿拉巴马，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show's in Alabama today, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，瑞秋偷走了我手下的一个女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, Rachel stole one of my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为制片人，我们决定何必浪费一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As producers, we decided why waste a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们想了个新环节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, we came up with a new segment
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用剩下的那些女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}using the girls who were left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。看看你，彻底独断专行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Look at you, going all rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧。继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这边的状况有点不太好控制\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, my situation here is a little less containable
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比我想的。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than I thought. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说的是几个小时，还是……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we talking a couple of hours, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很好，我也喜欢跟你在一起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're great, and I love spending time with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:18:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我这边真有事，你得，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I have a real issue here, and you need to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.38,0:18:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走人。我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，没事。别傻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's okay. Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我已经翘班好一阵了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I've been playing hooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我也该去办公室露个面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should probably make an appearance at the office anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好了就打电话给我。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call me when you're ready. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩……闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn... Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我得跟你说实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I got to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可真是个美人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is one beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂了……那个多元化天才那一套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get it... the whole diversified genius thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——我也能当那种人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I could be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不能，切特。我能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you can't, Chet. I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是能，早就做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you could have, you would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会成为那种人。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am going to be that guy. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会证明给你看。我会成为那种人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna prove it to you. I'm gonna be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想介绍韦格斯坦博士的“真相之镜”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like to introduce Dr. Wagerstein's "Mirror of Truth."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，她还想注册商标吗？是我想出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, is she like trademarking? I came up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便。那段我们剪掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever. We'll cut that part out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.19,0:18:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们所有人都要好好地、认真地看一看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of you will take a long, hard look
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:46.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真相之镜，然后告诉我们你们觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into the Mirror of Truth and tell us why you think
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯为什么没带你回家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius didn't take you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:53.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅尔，你准备好凝视真相之镜了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael, are you ready to gaze into the Mirror of Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这位完美小姐有什么要说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See what little Miss Perfect has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得达瑞斯没带我回家是因为他被我震慑到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Darius didn't take me home because he's intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我经常遇到这种情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，因为我聪明，男人们就觉得我没法，比如，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, because I'm smart, guys think that I can't, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}降到他们的层次，或者跟他们的朋友处得来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get down on their level or be cool with their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要我去给他们再送点酒吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to go give them more drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，麻烦用酒灌醉他们。她太势利了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, ply them with liquor, please. She's so snobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者也许他只是觉得我家人太讲究了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe he just thought my family was gonna be too fancy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者太古板什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or uptight or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:16.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟什么相比……？跟什么相比？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As opposed to...? As opposed to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:18.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我们的贫民窟家庭相比吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As opposed to our ghetto-ass families?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。我没那么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. That is not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用说出口，亲爱的，我听到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't have to say it, honey, I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是……你在曲解她的话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just... You're putting words in her mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。把镜子递给我，姐妹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Pass me the mirror, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我觉得达瑞斯没带我回家是因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I think Darius didn't take me home because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不喜欢警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he doesn't like cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，既然要说实话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, if we're being honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在这个小爱巢里就是要说实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's what we're doing in this little love nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，那短发……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we're being honest, the short hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全理解你想追求的效果，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, I totally get what you're going for,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:48.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我真的觉得这会让你有点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I really think that it makes you kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧。我头发怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say it. What about my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会让你看起来……有点像……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It kind of makes you look... like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:54.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像没有阴道一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you don't have a vagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说出来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:01.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你想制作点东西吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you want to produce something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，真正地制作？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, like, really produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。各位，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. You guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆森。嘿，嘿，嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jameson. Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:12.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这听着很难受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that must be difficult to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:14.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}表达一下你现在的感受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Express what your feelings are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这些贱人说得不对，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel like these bitches are wrong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的头发让我看起来坚强又凶悍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My hair makes me look strong and fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个男人都想插一个坚强凶悍的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every guy wants to stick it into someone strong and fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈尔德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沃瑟曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wasserman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。瑞秋，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Rachel, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。过来。过来。过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here. Come here. Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.03,0:20:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是这么想的。嘘！嘘！嘘！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's what I'm thinking. Shh! Shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们让达里厄斯……你听……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, we get Darius... Just listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。听我说一秒钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a minute. Just listen to me for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我简直有这辈子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I literally have the best news
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好的消息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've ever had in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:41.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗？是吗？什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you ready? Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安肚子里正怀着一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann has a future Trump supporter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:44.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}未来的特朗普支持者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}growing in her uterus right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怀了个什么？就是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got a what? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:47.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。我没开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. I'm not even kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怀孕了，我说服她今晚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's pregnant, and I convinced her to tell her parents
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在镜头前告诉父母和达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Darius on-camera tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用谢。哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我不明白你怎么不更兴奋点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I don't understand why you're not more excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:20:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我有很多事要做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyways, I have a lot to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头再聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.73,0:21:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰！杰！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay! Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想梳理一下流程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to talk through the process
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我这边要做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of what I've got going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是我觉得会需要的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, these are the things I think I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼，我马上回来。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman, I'll be back in a minute. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听着。我需要这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so listen. This is what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:17.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。想我了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说谁？我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you think? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你说瑞秋，她没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're talking about Rachel, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她为什么会有事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why wouldn't she be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得她没你就活不了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think she can't function without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你以为你是内幕先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and you think you're Mr. Inside Track?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她什么都没告诉你，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She hasn't told you a thing, has she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:34.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:36.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}懂吗？他昨晚打了她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? He slapped her around last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且她胳膊上上下都是淤青，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and apparently she's got bruises up and down her arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要让她留在片场，她就是个定时炸弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You keep her on that set, and she is a time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你现在送她回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to get her home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，我觉得她挺好，昆恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, she seems fine to me, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在正看着她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm looking at her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:51.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，让我猜猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，她缩在角落里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now, she's backed into a corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啃着手指像啃夹心蛋糕一样，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}chewing on her fingers like they're Twinkies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼睛发亮，说话的样子好像她的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}eyes a-blazing, talking as if her words
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能拯救世界似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are gonna save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我回头打给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好。好了，女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay. Okay, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们。女士们，继续吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies. Ladies, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙妮，你下一个吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany, why don't you go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得达里厄斯没选我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Darius didn't pick me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为他害怕自己的感情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because he's scared of his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一直承受着太多压力和期望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has so much pressure and expectation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.71,0:22:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}围绕着他。很可怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}surrounding him all the time. It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。你就继续这么骗自己吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我觉得他大概是怕那些性病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I think he's probably just scared of all the STDs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能都在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that are probably floating around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那张漂亮小嘴里飘着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in that pretty little mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有性病。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have any STDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她到底在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在说她……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's saying that she...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.95,0:22:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我听到了，丹。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I heard, Dan. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许他只是不想要他表弟的二手货？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe he just doesn't want his cousin's sloppy seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇哦。他表弟？你跟罗密欧搞上了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}W-whoa. His cousin? You got with Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪听来的？重要吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you hear that? Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:45.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才是不是给她递话了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just feed that to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.16,0:22:46.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你进去耳语了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you go in and whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在做制作，杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just producing, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙妮，这里是安全的空间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany, this is a safe space.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在大家都在敞开心扉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone's being open now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，太安全了。超级安全，蒂芙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's so safe. Super safe, Tiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说来听听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？你跟罗密欧搞上了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it true? Did you hook up with Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:02.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:03.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，但不是你想的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事！都2016年了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay! It's 2016!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:10.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是……根本不是你想的那样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not... It's so not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}足球公主，是吧？我们这屋里有两个荡妇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Football princess, hey? We got two sluts in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:16.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是警察！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a police officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是我真不敢相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just I can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事就这么落到我们头上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this whole thing just fell in our laps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。我们回去后有一大堆事要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach. We just have so much to do when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，听着，嘿。我真为我们高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, look, hey. I'm, like, so happy for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都有点动感情了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel kind of, like, emotional about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我知道发生了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？什么事？杰瑞米的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? With what? With Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.91,0:23:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩刚打电话告诉我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn just called and told me just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她担心你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.88,0:23:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全没事，好吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm totally fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.75,0:23:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全没事。我不……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm totally fine. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.48,0:23:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，我现在就想去机场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My thing is I want to get to the airport right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得回去，我得处理杰瑞米的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got to get back, and I got to deal with Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要他退出节目。永远不准他进片场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want him off the show. He's never allowed on set ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太夸张了。这根本没那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are being so dramatic. This is, like, not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你把整件事轻描淡写得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you're downplaying this entire thing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点太过了。我不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a little too much. I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:48.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……对，我完全没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is... Yeah, I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.73,0:23:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想知道为什么我没事吗？我……你看起来可不像没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to know why I'm fine? I'm... You don't seem fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我完全没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I am totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就坐在这里，做我的工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, sitting here, and I'm doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拼了命在工作，好吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm working my ass off. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:56.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在制作这个节目，跟这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm producing this show with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.17,0:23:57.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了。怀孕的种族主义小妞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay. Pregnant racist chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了好了。我是说，这简直是天赐良机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay, okay. I mean, this is like manna from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:02.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道我们在说什么。抱歉。我下一个要点是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what we are talking about. I'm sorry. My next point here...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在让我觉得自己疯了。我下一个要点是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're making me feel crazy right now. My next point here is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我担心的是曝光一个怀孕的女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm worried about outing a pregnant girl
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.64,0:24:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在全国电视上，当着她家人的面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in front of her family on national television.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你关心的就是她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is who you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你状态不对，还把气撒在贝丝·安身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not yourself, and you're taking it out on Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们下来这里是为了把黑人追求者带到南方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We came down here to bring a black suitor to the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.05,0:24:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我们的计划。这就是我们要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was our plan. This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.65,0:24:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这个。我觉得你今天神经兮兮的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just that. I feel like you're jumpy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.89,0:24:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太震惊了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:19.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想提醒你这季我们都干了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to remind you what we have done this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把一个小妞锁在房间里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We locked, like, some chick in a room,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雇了个群演选角的人来撒谎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hired an extras casting to come in and lie
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说她是她妈妈。没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and say that she's her mother. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.53,0:24:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我们给他打硬膜外麻醉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, we give him an epidural.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.67,0:24:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们让鲁比的父亲带着摄像机进来。瑞秋，我知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have Ruby's father come in with the cameras. Rachel, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可这是那个怀孕的女孩。他们没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this is the pregnant girl. They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.04,0:24:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你气的是她？你关心的是她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is who you're mad about? This is who you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我担心的是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.61,0:24:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.31,0:24:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.78,0:24:40.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？那我们能不能赶紧去把这事搞大？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? So can we please go and just blow this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}O0 C1 嘿，你在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 Hey, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么一脸难过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why the sad face...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了被香槟泼了一身之外？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Other than being doused in champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.03,0:25:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.87,0:25:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许是因为我被困在一栋大豪宅里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe it's because I'm stuck in a McMansion
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.97,0:25:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟三个爱八卦的贱人在一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with three gossipy bitches
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.84,0:25:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而达里厄斯在阿拉巴马跟三K党小妞在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while Darius is in Alabama with little Miss Ku Klux Klan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道那些女孩是怎么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know how those girls
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.61,0:25:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道罗密欧的事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}found out about Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我告诉你我能帮你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if I told you I could help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么帮？跟整个团队上床吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How? By sleeping with the entire team?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个交易要跟你做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got a deal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.32,0:25:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听我的建议，我就让你进达里厄斯的房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You take my advice, I'll get you into Darius' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把罗密欧这堆事都抛到脑后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You leave all this Romeo business behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那回报呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我介绍给你爸，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You introduce me to your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.93,0:25:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稍微软化他一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}soften him up a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.60,0:25:36.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让我的投资组合多元化，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm looking to diversify my portfolio,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许买支职业橄榄球队的少数股份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}maybe take a minority interest in a pro football team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你帮我这个忙，我就让你进最后两强，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You help me out, I'll get you in the final two,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.11,0:25:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，呃，我会尽我所能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, uh, I'll do everything in my power
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.21,0:25:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你送上圣坛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to get you to the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心背景……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about the background...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:55.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}越乱越好。说实话，这对我来说没问题……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The messier, the better. Honestly, that's fine with...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.26,0:26:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.19,0:26:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你知道瑞秋在哪儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, you know where Rachel is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.39,0:26:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道，她在B机位那边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she's over with "B" cam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.03,0:26:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要从另一个角度拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna shoot from a different angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？一切还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on? Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我不知道我能不能做到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if I can do this, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，如果你不想告诉父母，那就别说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, if you don't want to tell your parents, then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.90,0:26:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但瑞秋说这是唯一的机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but Rachel said that this is the only chance
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能告诉达里厄斯，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna get to tell Darius, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.81,0:26:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我知道她跟你说了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I know what she told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.18,0:26:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就做你觉得对的事，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do whatever feels right for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我听瑞秋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'm gonna listen to Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.91,0:26:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她知道自己在做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she knows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.85,0:26:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……抱歉打扰你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm... I'm sorry that I bothered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.15,0:26:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.69,0:26:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想说几句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to say Ha few words.?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.86,0:26:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，B机位，到后面就位。首先，感谢大家今晚过来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, "B" cam, move into position near the back. First off, thank you, everyone, for coming tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.26,0:26:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主要是为了达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mostly to Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢你大老远来阿拉巴马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you so much for coming all the way down to Alabama.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，大家给他热烈掌声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Let's have a big hand for him, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.27,0:26:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴你能来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:47.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就告诉她，她……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just gonna tell her, you know, that she...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.37,0:26:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是你梦寐以求的女人。她怀着你的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the woman of your dreams. She's carrying your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有她，你的人生就不一样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your life wouldn't be the same without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.91,0:26:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要把这个给她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna give her this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你买了戒指。天啊。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you bought a ring. Oh, my God. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这儿什么都考虑到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We think of everything around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.01,0:26:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也意味着你和我之间有某种联系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It also means that you and I, We share a connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:27:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了保持这种联系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and in order to keep that connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.75,0:27:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须对你坦白，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to be honest with you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.42,0:27:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也对今晚在场的所有人坦白，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and with everyone else here tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有件事，呃，不太容易说出口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about something that is, um, not so easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.47,0:27:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫布洛克来。贝丝·安！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get Brock. Beth Ann!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……呃，不要！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What... Uh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.94,0:27:20.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我尽快赶来了。我好想你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came as soon as I could. I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.44,0:27:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在这里干什么？你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he doing here? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布洛克，起来！你在干什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brock, get up! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.28,0:27:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我的女人，贝丝·安。别这样对我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my girl, Beth Ann. Do not do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.98,0:27:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直是我的女人。我好爱你，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Y-You've always been my girl. I love you so much, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.75,0:27:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我是在问，你愿不愿意做我的妻子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now I'm asking i-if you will be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.28,0:27:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！不？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，喂！关摄像机！把那台摄像机拿开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey! Cameras off! Get that camera off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关摄像机！快点儿！你说“不”是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cameras off! Come on, now! What do you mean "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.29,0:27:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我，我们得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and me, we need to have
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.96,0:27:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在得换种方式谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a different kind of conversation right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不行，爸爸。你怀着我的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not right now, Daddy. You're carrying my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.13,0:27:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又不确定。你是说孩子不是我的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know that. You're saying it's not mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.46,0:27:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说我不知道孩子是谁的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm saying that I don't know whose baby it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安，孩子还能是谁的？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann, whose baby could it be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.00,0:27:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，绝对不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hell, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.97,0:27:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，我从没……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man, I never t...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.78,0:27:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他我从没碰过她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him I never touched her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.34,0:28:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好没把脏手伸到我女人身上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better not have put your filthy hands on my girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.45,0:28:02.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你得走！瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is why you need to go! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.35,0:28:08.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布洛克，这孩子不是你的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brock, this baby is not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.19,0:28:09.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从那边推近镜头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Push in from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.79,0:28:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！！我爱他！！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it!! I love him!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，什么？你爱我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what? You love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.33,0:28:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:17.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点。冷静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pump your brakes. Pump your brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.76,0:28:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没想到会这样，但我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know it was possible, but I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:20.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点。冷静点。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pump your brakes. Pump your brakes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊。放马过来。对啊，怎么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Bring it. Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm he...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:27.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在马上给我出去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you get on out of here right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.34,0:28:28.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然我就叫治安官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or I'm calling the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.18,0:28:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.49,0:28:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你变成什么蠢婊子了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of stupid whore did you turn into?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.49,0:28:44.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，嘴巴放干净点，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, watch your mouth, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.79,0:28:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你闭嘴。滚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shut your mouth. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.29,0:28:50.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！噢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.26,0:28:53.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？我现在很尴尬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel? I'm embarrassed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:55.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你。拿着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here you go. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太感谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.07,0:29:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.51,0:29:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。天啊！我控制不住自己！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Oh, my God! I can't help myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.11,0:29:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.02,0:29:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……我真为我们高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... I'm so happy for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.42,0:29:12.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.02,0:29:15.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.03,0:29:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}O0 C1 欢迎回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.93,0:29:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。没完没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. It never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我必须跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I just have to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.57,0:29:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.97,0:29:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我真的很喜欢你，达里厄斯，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, the truth is, I really like you, Darius,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:38.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没选我，我有点受伤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I was kind of hurt that you didn't pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.04,0:29:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我想被贝丝·安的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I wanted to get attacked by Beth Ann's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.91,0:29:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吸毒鬼男友袭击吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}meth-head boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.55,0:29:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。我被耍了，蒂芙妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I got played, Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.92,0:29:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}废话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我们一直被人操控，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I feel like we're getting manipulated
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.95,0:29:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一步都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.55,0:29:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从到这儿第一天起就被操控了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been manipulated since the first day I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:51.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在乎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:55.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是罗密欧的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's about Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.09,0:29:56.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗密欧怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，怎么，你现在想把蒂芙妮赶走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what, you're trying to get rid of Tiffany now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.20,0:30:00.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？不。我是在帮她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? No. I'm trying to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.23,0:30:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我建议她跟达里厄斯把话说开的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the one who suggested she clear the air with Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.57,0:30:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这叫诚实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's called honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.57,0:30:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}屡试不爽。这样才能得到你想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wins every time. It's how you get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.37,0:30:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, just give it up, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，我还没开始呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't even started, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:12.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本还没开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have not even started.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.24,0:30:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你终于回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finally, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.95,0:30:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，瑞秋，我们去我办公室谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Rachel, let's go talk in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家一起谈。各位能不能先出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's all talk. Could everyone step outside
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.15,0:30:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我们留点空间？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and give us a moment, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们又没在干活什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We weren't working or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真不知道你们这些人到底是什么毛病！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what the hell is wrong with you people!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.63,0:30:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种事有流程的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's procedures for things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.43,0:30:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得报警，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need to call the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.10,0:30:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿到报警记录，然后通知人事部。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get a police report, and then we call HR.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.93,0:30:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！喂！谁都不准报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hey! Nobody's calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这已经定了。你们两个定的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's been decided. By you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.17,0:30:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋和我商量过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel and I discussed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.47,0:30:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，不报警，不调查。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no police, no investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对大家都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's best for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.18,0:30:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你想怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.05,0:30:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的决定，不是我们的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your decision, it's not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.05,0:30:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我。别看他俩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me. Don't look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.09,0:30:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在别看他俩。看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't look at them right now. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.12,0:31:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我陪着你……你想怎么做都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here for you... whatever you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.33,0:31:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我想算了。我不想报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I want to drop it. I don't want to go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.43,0:31:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.57,0:31:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，她确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, she's sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.24,0:31:12.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话你哪句没听懂？等等……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What part of that did you not get? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.34,0:31:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们该感到羞愧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should be ashamed of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.58,0:31:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们两个都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.68,0:31:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们家到底怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell's happening to our family?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.98,0:31:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自从科尔曼来了，一切全完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ever since Coleman's got here, everything's gone to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.49,0:31:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那小子就像癌症。我们得把他切掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That boy's like a cancer. We need to cut him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.19,0:31:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么切？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.99,0:31:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我觉得瑞秋爱上那家伙了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I think Rachel's in love with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.49,0:31:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过她这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never seen her like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.30,0:31:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.10,0:31:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.31,0:31:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊，美人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.35,0:32:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在是今晚的淘汰仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now it is time for tonight's elimination ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.26,0:32:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四位女士拿到了达里厄斯心门的钥匙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four of our ladies have won keys to Darius' heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.10,0:32:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很遗憾，有一位没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One, unfortunately, has not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，镜头拉开，把整个房间拍进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's widen out and get the whole room, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.03,0:32:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚那位女士得说再见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that lady tonight will need to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.53,0:32:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.18,0:32:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尚塔尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.02,0:32:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，镜头推近达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's go tight on Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.72,0:32:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅艾尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jameson.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.10,0:32:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.51,0:33:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前说过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've said this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诚实大概是最重要的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honesty is probably the most important thing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在……这方面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in terms of...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.78,0:33:07.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我必须说点话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I need to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.09,0:33:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须说出真相。贝丝·安……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to tell the truth. Beth Ann...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.45,0:33:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！我想让全美国都知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! I want America to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.59,0:33:13.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从没碰过我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you never touched me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.22,0:33:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪怕我有多希望被你碰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as much as I might have wanted you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.63,0:33:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直是个完美的绅士，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been a perfect gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.56,0:33:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and there's no way that you could be
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.37,0:33:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我孩子的父亲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the father of my child...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.63,0:33:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非，不知怎么的，你选择当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}unless, somehow, you chose to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.07,0:33:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段给达里厄斯推个特写。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Push in on Darius for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.64,0:33:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他难受个够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's really make him uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.78,0:33:31.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我刚来时是另一个人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I came here a different person
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.54,0:33:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带着些不太好的想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with some not-so-good ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今晚请别淘汰我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But please don't cut me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.08,0:33:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下有好戏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.62,0:33:41.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我证明我们能成为绝佳的一对，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me show you that we can make a great team,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能组成一个家庭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we can make a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.12,0:33:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。我不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.83,0:33:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是……像你刚才那样站出来需要勇气，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But... it took guts to stand up like you just did,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.33,0:33:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想留一笔钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's why I want to put some money aside
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.73,0:33:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你孩子当大学基金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for your kid's college fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.47,0:34:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这举动真有风度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a classy act.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.82,0:34:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.12,0:34:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了各位，就位，让\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, guys. Let's position up to get
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.82,0:34:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镜头对准贝丝·安，等她哭着出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}those cameras onto Beth Ann when she comes out crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安，该我们跟你道别了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann, it is time for us to bid you adieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.34,0:34:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沙扬娜拉。再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sayonara. Adiós.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.57,0:34:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沙洛姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shalom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各两次，亲爱的。开战吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two each, honey. Game on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.47,0:34:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}省省吧，贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.82,0:34:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开，别烦我！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是很讨厌，但刚才真让人难过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was obnoxious, but that was really sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.79,0:34:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.59,0:34:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。刚才那到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我不知道。贝丝·安就，那个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I have no idea. Beth Ann just, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.23,0:34:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受够这些破事了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sick of this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.73,0:34:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。我觉得作为一个女人，你表现得棒极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen. I thought, as a woman, that you came off great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.33,0:34:58.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来对她的处境特别体谅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You seemed, like, so sensitive to her situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，我刚把一个哭着的大肚子女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I just kicked a crying, pregnant lady
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.40,0:35:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赶出我家……我家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}out of my house... My house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧，我受够你了。我受够这些烂事了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I'm so over you. I'm so over this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。达……“达”。达里厄斯！达里厄斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. D... "D." Darius! Darius!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.24,0:35:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁上了那个种……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who banged the ra...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.34,0:35:09.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Rach!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁睡了那个种族主义者？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who banged the racist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.32,0:35:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}O0 C1\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.22,0:35:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.49,0:35:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我很好奇你为什么在我办公室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, curious as to why you are in my office
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在跟我说话，但除此之外，挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}talking to me right now, but other than that, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.60,0:35:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是得问一下，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just had to ask, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.93,0:35:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么把那个英俊、迷人、清醒的男人打发走了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why did you send that gorgeous, charming, sober man away?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁，布斯？我有工作要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who, Booth? I had work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.67,0:35:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:44.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实际上，有。我们有个紧急情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, yes. We had an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}娱乐圈不存在什么紧急情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no such thing as an entertainment emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:47.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事跟节目无关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This wasn't about the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.85,0:35:50.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, then? Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.68,0:35:53.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有问过自己，为什么那么在意那女孩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you asked yourself why you care so much about that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.89,0:35:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下有得好听了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This will be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:36:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要告诉你一件\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna tell you the one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.43,0:36:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别人都不敢当面跟你说的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}no one else is brave enough to say to your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很孤独。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.70,0:36:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孤独？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.00,0:36:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我整天被人围着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am surrounded all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一半时间都在冲人喊，让他们别烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spend half my time screaming at people to leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的是亲密，奎恩……‘看见我’的那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm talking about intimacy, Quinn... "In-to-me-see."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.38,0:36:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你中风了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you having a stroke?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个节目……它把你吞噬了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show... It consumes you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.35,0:36:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是你拥有的一切，但不一定非得这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all you have, but it doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:27.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不必像你爸那样孤独地死去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to die alone like your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:30.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.46,0:36:34.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我该听你的建议？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm supposed to be taking advice from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.93,0:36:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个薪水低、永远单身、可悲的真人秀心理医生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Underpaid, forever single, pathetic reality-show therapist?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.90,0:36:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可这个人是真的关心你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who actually cares about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.74,0:36:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别把和他的关系搞砸了，奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't sabotage it with this guy, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.90,0:36:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可能是你最后的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He may be your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.59,0:37:10.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你在这儿啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.63,0:37:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你确定这整件事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, are you sure about this whole thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.90,0:37:15.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不报警这件事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The not calling the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我确定。我真的觉得这是对的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I am. I really think it's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.74,0:37:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是正确的做法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.47,0:37:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得问你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.87,0:37:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件事你为什么不告诉我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't you tell me about this whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.51,0:37:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情一发生，你为什么不直接告诉我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right when it happened, why didn't you just tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不信任我吗？如果你不信任我，那……为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you not trust me? And if you don't trust me, then... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.68,0:37:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩说你是我的切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn says that you're my Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.02,0:37:37.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道那是什么意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.09,0:37:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我知道我和切特没什么共同点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do know I don't have a lot in common with Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.66,0:37:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我不会让你留在这里烂十年……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I'm not gonna leave you here to fester for 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.73,0:37:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩干这行多久了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How long's Quinn been doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.00,0:37:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.03,0:37:47.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十年？不，不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 years? Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，我看得到你现在是什么样，也看得到你能成为什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see who you are, Rachel, and who you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.60,0:37:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一季结束后我就带你离开这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am taking you out of here at the end of the season
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.87,0:37:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管奎恩喜不喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}whether Quinn likes it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.35,0:38:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.42,0:38:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.35,0:38:09.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我想要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.69,0:38:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想让任何事介入我们之间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want anything to come between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.13,0:38:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.93,0:38:23.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ohh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.60,0:38:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.41,0:38:32.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.01,0:38:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，它来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, it's coming
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.01,0:38:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.15,0:38:40.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ohh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.45,0:38:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.42,0:38:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我能感觉到它来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I can feel it coming
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.59,0:38:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 终结将至\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The end is coming
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.53,0:38:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 终结\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The end
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.54,0:38:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 最好开始逃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Better start runnin'
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.80,0:39:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 终结\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The end
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:04.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我听见鼓声，鼓声，鼓声 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I hear the drummin', drummin', drummin' *
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。别再缠着我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Stop stalking me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.02,0:39:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我穷追不舍，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm relentless, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你在重新考虑波斯特牧场？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you were rethinking the Post Ranch?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.79,0:39:17.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有可能，但我明天有大事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Possibly, but I have a big day tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.62,0:39:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我某种程度上推动起来的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something that I kind of set into motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:24.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那今晚边吃晚饭边聊，怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how about we discuss it over dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:27.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这就来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.47,0:39:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
